 - phytec-qt6demo-image:
  * phyboard-zeta-imx7d-1


Build Environment:
------------------

- Ubuntu 20.04 64-bit


Features:
---------

- Switched to PHYTEC ampliPHY distro
  Supported features:
    * Debug UART
    * Heartbeat & CPU activity LEDs
    * GPIO buttons & LEDs
    * eMMC
    * SPI-Nor flash
    * 1x CAN
    * 2x Ethernet
    * 1x RS232
    * SD card
    * I2C EEPROM
    * I2C RTC
    * USB 2.0
    * LVDS
